WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.410
This Christmas, one
shawarma isn't enough.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Buy two.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.490
Enjoy one.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.710
The second one goes
to someone in need.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.170
And for every donated meal,
Shawarma Moods adds one dollar.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.500
The goal?

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.610
One thousand meals.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.610
Bring a friend.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.650
Share the story.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.930
Watch the counter grow.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.670
Prepared fresh, and shared
during Christmas week.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.320
Un pour toi, un pour eux.

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:58.600
Partage le mood.

